scratch/

# Borrowed assets.
#
# Nothing is borrowed and nothing can be: assets from an escrowed resource are encrypted and
# make FiveM refuse to load this one. The pattern stays so a copy made in haste is not also
# committed. See ASSET-001 in docs/internal/TASKS.md.
stream/w_am_hose.*

# `data/*.meta` used to be ignored alongside it, back when the only metas here were SmartHose's.
# They are ours now -- written from the schema, naming our own model -- so they are committed
# like any other source file. They are also useless without stream/w_mi_nozzle.ydr, and the
# resource will not load the weapon if any of the three disagree, which conventions_spec tests.

# Crash dumps land here when the client goes down while this resource is being tested. They are
# multi-megabyte and specific to one session, and the useful part -- the log and crashometry.json
# -- gets read and written up rather than committed.
logs/
